&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Konrad is a next-generation digital consultancy that solves complex business problems for global clients with creative, forward-thinking solutions. We&#39;re passionate about innovation and about building best-in-class digital and AI-enabled products.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Konrad is looking for a Senior Consultant to join our Strategy team. You&#39;ll lead cross-functional teams through medium and large-scale digital and AI projects, and guide clients through design thinking to deliver cutting-edge experiences that put AI to work where it creates real value.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Support engagement leads on projects ranging from rapid-to-market initiatives to large-scale digital and AI transformations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Shape and create digital and AI-enabled solutions for clients across a range of industries&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Lead strategy and design thinking workshops with clients, including helping them find and prioritize digital and AI opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Interpret client business challenges and work with design and technology teams to solve them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Make sure client goals and project timelines are met&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Act as a thought leader on emerging digital and AI trends, for clients and within Konrad&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Create presentations, documentation and proposal responses, using digital and AI tools to work efficiently&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Mentor junior team members, including helping them use AI tools well in their day-to-day work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; 4+ years of relevant experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Experience leading strategy, design and technology teams on medium to large digital projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Experience shaping or delivering AI-related initiatives, or a strong understanding of how AI fits into digital products and business processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; A strong understanding of management, business and finance processes, including building the business case for digital and AI investments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; A proven track record of client collaboration and relationship management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; A demonstrated passion for UX, digital design and technology&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; A commitment to continuous learning about emerging technologies, especially AI&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; A strong eye for quality digital design&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Excellent communication and public speaking skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; An analytical mindset and strong problem-solving skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; The ability to work well both on a team and independently&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Mentoring experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Perks and Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Comprehensive Health &amp;amp; Wellness Benefits Package&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Socials, Outings &amp;amp; Retreats&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Retirement Planning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Parental Leave Program&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Annual tech &amp;amp; travel allowance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Culture of Learning &amp;amp; Development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Flexible Working Hours&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Work from Home Flexibility&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Service Recognition Programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Points&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Have you taken any courses at BrainStation? A lot of our design and development best practices and processes are taught during our courses - make sure to highlight this experience in your cover letter if you have!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Konrad is committed to maintaining a diverse work environment and is proud to be an equal opportunity employer. All qualified applicants, regardless of race, color, religion, gender, gender identity or expression, sexual orientation, national origin, genetics, disability, age, or veteran status will receive consideration for employment.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The estimated compensation for this position is $100,000 to $115,000. This is an estimate and a compensation offer will vary based on applicant&#39;s education, experience, skills, abilities and alignment with market data.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;While we sincerely appreciate all applications, only those candidates selected for an interview will be contacted.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Hybrid&lt;/p&gt;
